{"version":1,"content":"<p>前無綫藝人馬賽日前接受HOY節目《九運會客室2》訪問，首度大談當年不雅片段曝光後的經歷，親自剖白由接獲消息到召開記者招待會的心路歷程。</p><p>馬賽2008年參選港姐而入行，一直發展順利，但於2014年，她多次傳出負面新聞，除爆介入富婆跟女製片的同性</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T08:55:28.702657+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T08:14:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T08:48:39.303499+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T08:48:39.303499+00:00","content_hash":"66b08aa23fbe28be2990103be19fd527a624e8a59caa9cf7ee1ae5d8759c1c5f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}